      'worsted yarn is spun from combed fibre where all the fibres are laid parallel and the short ones removed it is spun with a short draw and higher twist the result is smooth dense strong lustrous drapes and holds a crease but is heavier and less insulating used for suiting fine tailoring and hard wearing garments',
